  "text": "\r\n<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN\" >\r\n<HTML>\r\n  <!--%@ OutputCache Duration=60 VaryByParam=\"flora_id;taxon_id\"  %-->\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n<!-- Google Tag Manager -->\r\n<script>(function(w,d,s,l,i){w[l]=w[l]||[];w[l].push({'gtm.start':\r\nnew Date().getTime(),event:'gtm.js'});var f=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],\r\nj=d.createElement(s),dl=l!='dataLayer'?'&l='+l:'';j.async=true;j.src=\r\n'https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtm.js?id='+i+dl;f.parentNode.insertBefore(j,f);\r\n})(window,document,'script','dataLayer','GTM-TGK4SMV');</script>\r\n<!-- End Google Tag Manager -->\r\n<title>Hedera in Flora of China @ efloras.org</title>\r\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href='/templates/eflora.css' />\r\n<script src=\"JavaScript/eflora.js\" type=\"text/javascript\" ></script>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n\r\n  <!-- body onload=\"formMOMap.submit()\" -->\r\n  <body>\r\n\r\n    <TABLE id=\"TableMain\" cellSpacing=\"1\" cellPadding=\"1\" width=\"640\" border=\"0\">\r\n      <TR>\r\n        <TD><!--%@ Register TagPrefix=\"ucFlora\" TagName=\"TaxonSearchBox\" Src=\"TaxonSearchBox.ascx\" %-->\r\n\r\n<script language=\"javascript\">\r\n\r\nfunction jsClearTextBox(sender)\r\n{\r\n  // alert(formSearchBox[\"name_str\"].id);\r\n  // alert(sender.value);\r\n  if (sender.value == \"taxon name\")\r\n  {\r\n    sender.value = \"\";\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n</script>\r\n<table id=\"ucEfloraHeader_tableHeaderWrapper\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n\t<tr>\r\n\t\t<TD style=\"WIDTH: 479px\"><a id=\"ucEfloraHeader_linkFloraHome\" title=\"Flora Homepage\" href=\"flora_page.aspx?flora_id=2\"><img src=\"images/flora/eflora-logo-2.gif\" id=\"ucEfloraHeader_imageLogo\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Link to Flora of China home\" /><br>\r\n        </a></TD>\r\n\t\t<TD valign=\"bottom\" align=\"right\">\r\n      <div id=\"ucEfloraHeader_panelSearchBox\">\r\n\t\t\t <!-- begin of search box -->\r\n        <FORM name=\"formSearchBox\" action=\"browse.aspx\" method=\"get\">\r\n          <TABLE borderColor=\"#ccffcc\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"2\" width=\"200\" border=\"1\">\r\n            <TR>\r\n              <TD>\r\n                <span id=\"ucEfloraHeader_lblSearchBox\"><INPUT TYPE='Hidden' NAME='flora_id' ' id='flora_id' VALUE='2' >\n&nbsp;<input id=name_str name=name_str &nbsp;  value=''  class=small title='Use % as the wildcard\r\n(e.g. pinus % or pinus a%)'  onfocus='jsClearTextBox(this);' accessKey=s size=15> <input class=small type=submit value=Search name=btnSearch><br>\n <input name=chkAllFloras type=checkbox   > <span class=small>All Floras &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<A HREF='search_page.aspx?flora_id=2'  TARGET='_top'  class='a.link.small'>Advanced Search</A></span>\n</span></TD>\r\n            </TR>\r\n          </TABLE>\r\n        </FORM> <!-- end of search box -->\r\n      \r\n\t\t</div>\r\n    </TD>\r\n\t</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n</TD>\r\n      </TR>\r\n      <TR>\r\n        <TD id=\"tdSubHeader\">\r\n<table id=\"FooterTableOut\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#999999\"><img src=\"~/images/layout/dot.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"1\"></td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <TD>\r\n      <table bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" id=\"footerTable\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"WIDTH: 291px\">FOC Vol. 13 Page 435, 436, 437, <b>441</b></td>\r\n          <TD align=\"right\">\r\n            <span id=\"ucEfloraSubHeader_lblLinks\"><a target='_top' href='/login.aspx'>Login</a>\n | <A HREF='/index.aspx'  TARGET='_top' >eFloras Home</A> | <A HREF='/help_page.aspx'  TARGET='_top' >Help</A></span></TD>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </table>\r\n    </TD>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#999999\"><img src=\"~/images/layout/dot.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"1\"></td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</TD>\r\n      </TR>\r\n      <TR>\r\n        <TD id=\"tdBody\">\r\n          <table id=\"tableBody\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n            <tr>\r\n              <td id=\"tdLeftBar\" valign=\"top\" width=\"0\"></td>\r\n\r\n              <td id=\"tdContent\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"1930\">\r\n                <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n                  <tr>\r\n                    <td vAlign=\"top\">\r\n                      <table id=\"tableTaxonChain\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n\t<tr>\r\n\t\t<td><span id=\"lblTaxonChain\"><font size=\"2\"><A HREF='flora_page.aspx?flora_id=2'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='Flora homepage' >FOC</A> | <A HREF='browse.aspx?flora_id=2'  TARGET='_top' >Family List</A> | <A HREF='volume_page.aspx?volume_id=2013&flora_id=2'  TARGET='_top' >FOC Vol. 13</A> | <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=2&taxon_id=10058'  TARGET='_top' >Araliaceae</A> <A HREF='browse.aspx?flora_id=2&start_taxon_id=10058'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='lower taxa' ><img border='0' src='images/layout/icon-list.gif'></A></font></span></td>\r\n\t</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n                      <P></P>\r\n                      <div id=\"panelTaxonTreatment\">\r\n\t\r\n                        <span id=\"lblTaxonDesc\"><!-- Default Template -->\r\n9. <b>Hedera</b> Linnaeus, Sp. Pl.  1: 202.  1753.  \n<p>常春藤属 chang chun teng shu \r\n<P>\r\n\r\n<P>\r\n\r\n<P>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\nWoody vines, evergreen, hermaphroditic or andromonoecious, creeping or climbing by aerial roots, unarmed. Leaves simple, entire or coarsely lobed, those of fertile shoots differentiated; stipules absent. Inflorescence a terminal, compact raceme of umbels, or occasionally umbels solitary. Pedicels not articulate below ovary. Calyx subentire or 5-toothed. Petals 5, valvate. Stamens 5. Ovary 5-carpellate; styles united into a short column. Fruit a drupe, globose. Seeds ovoid; endosperm ruminate.<p>\r\n\r\nAbout 15 species: N Africa, tropical and subtropical Asia, Europe; two species in China.<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\nAmong recent literature the following are relevant: Ackerfield and Wen, A morphometric analysis of <i>Hedera</i> L. (the ivy genus, Araliaceae) and its taxonomic implications (Adansonia, sér. 3, 24: 197-212. 2002); Ackerfield and Wen, Evolution of <i>Hedera</i> (the ivy genus, Araliaceae): insights from chloroplast DNA data (Int. J. Pl. Sci. 164: 593-602. 2003).<p><p><i>Hedera hypoglauca</i> Hance is the basionym of <i>Ampelopsis hypoglauca</i> (Hance) C. L. Li in the Vitaceae (see Fl. China 12).<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<P>\r\n</span>\r\n                        <P><!-- Key -->\r\n                        <div id=\"panelKey\">\r\n\t\t\r\n                          <BR clear=\"all\">\r\n                          <table id=\"tableKey\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n\t\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#d5ffff\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<TD width=\"347\">\r\n                                <P>\r\n                                  <span id=\"lblKeyTitle\"><b><font size=\"2\"></font></b></span></P>\r\n                              </TD>\r\n\t\t\t\t<TD nowrap=\"nowrap\" align=\"right\">\r\n                                <P>\r\n                                  <span id=\"lblKeyEditLink\"><font size=\"1\"></font></span></P>\r\n                              </TD>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#f1ffff\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<TD colspan=\"2\">\r\n                                <P>\r\n                                  <span id=\"lblKeyDesc\"><font size=\"2\"></font></span></P>\r\n                                <P>\r\n                                  <span id=\"lblKey\"><TABLE  WIDTH='100%' BORDER='0' >\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-1'>1</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Young branches and inflorescences with ferruginous scales; calyx subentire, ca. 2 mm; petals 3-3.5 mm; fruit red or yellow at maturity.</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP>1 <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=2&taxon_id=200015221'  TARGET='_top' ><i>H. nepalensis</i> var. <i>sinensis</i></A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Young branches and inflorescences stellate pubescent; calyx 5-lobed, ca. 1 mm; petals 2-2.5 mm; fruit black at maturity.</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP>2 <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=2&taxon_id=200015223'  TARGET='_top' ><i>H. rhombea</i> var. <i>formosana</i></A></td>\n</TR>\n</TABLE>\n</span></P>\r\n                              </TD>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#d5ffff\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<TD colspan=\"2\">\r\n                                <span id=\"lblKeyList\"><font size=\"2\"></font></span></TD>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t</table>\r\n\t\t\r\n                        \r\n\t</div></P> \r\n                        <P>\r\n                          <span id=\"lblLowerTaxonList\"><p>\n<B>Lower Taxa</B><br>\n<ul>\n<li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=2&taxon_id=200015221' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Hedera</b> <b>nepalensis</b> var. <b>sinensis</b>  (Tobler) Rehder</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=2&taxon_id=200015223' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Hedera</b> <b>rhombea</b> var. <b>formosana</b>  (Nakai) H. L. Li</A></ul>\n<p>\n</span></P>\r\n                        <BR clear=\"all\">\r\n                        <P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n                        <table id=\"tableObjectList\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\" width=\"100%\" border=\"1\">\r\n\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\">\r\n\t\t\t<TD>\r\n                              <TABLE cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n                                <TR>\r\n                                  <TD>\r\n                                    <span id=\"Label1\"><font size=\"2\">\r\n                                      <b>Related Objects</b>\r\n                                    </font></span></TD>\r\n                                  <TD align=\"right\">\r\n                                    <span id=\"lblGalleryLink\"><font size=\"1\"></font></span>&nbsp;</TD>\r\n                                </TR>\r\n                              </TABLE>\r\n                            </TD>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<TD>\r\n                              <span id=\"lblObjectList\"><TABLE  WIDTH='100%' BORDER='0' \n\t cellspacing=0>\n<TR >\n  <td width=400><li><A HREF='http://flora.huh.harvard.edu/china/PDF/PDF13/Hedera.pdf' \n\tTITLE='PDF' >Hedera.pdf</A></td>\n  <td class='small'>PDF</td>\n</TR>\n</TABLE>\n</span></TD>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</table>\r\n\t\r\n                        <P></P>\r\n                      \r\n</div>\r\n                      <P><div id=\"panelTaxonLinks\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</P>\r\n                      <P>\r\n                        <table id=\"tableLinkList\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\" width=\"100%\" border=\"1\">\r\n\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\">\r\n\t\t\t<TD><span id=\"lblLinkTitle\"><font size=\"2\"><b>Related Links</b> (opens in a new window)</font></span></TD>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<TD>\r\n                              <P><span id=\"lblLinkList\"><b>Treatments in Other Floras @ www.efloras.org</b><ul>\n<li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=110&taxon_id=114808'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='treatment in Annotated Checklist of the Flowering Plants of Nepal' >Annotated Checklist of the Flowering Plants of Nepal</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=3&taxon_id=114808'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='treatment in Chinese Plant Names' >Chinese Plant Names</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=11&taxon_id=114808'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='treatment in Flora of Missouri' >Flora of Missouri</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=114808'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='treatment in Flora of Pakistan' >Flora of Pakistan</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=101&taxon_id=114808'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='treatment in Flora of Taiwan Checklist' >Flora of Taiwan Checklist</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=114808'  TARGET='_to